# The best setting with the held buffer at 1.5 MiB: a 1 MiB WRITE and its
# header do not fit in the window a 1 MiB buffer gives, so the client
# stops part-way through each and waits for the window to reopen.
#     RX_LINGER_US=50 PLACE=1 STEP_BS=8M STEP_JOBS=16 PRP_DIR=/hs/stripe/zcbudget TRIM=/hs/stripe
512 1572864 0 prp step-copy-n16
